00:19:42.062 --> 00:19:47.062
♪ Oh freedom over me, over me ♪

00:19:48.073 --> 00:19:53.073
♪ And before I be a slave,
I'll be buried in my grave ♪

00:19:55.207 --> 00:20:00.207
♪ And go home to my Lord and be free ♪

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:06.100
♪ I woke up this morning
with my mind set on freedom ♪

00:20:08.192 --> 00:20:13.192
♪ Oh, I woke up this morning
with my mind set on freedom ♪

00:20:15.679 --> 00:20:20.679
♪ Oh, I woke up this morning
with my mind set on freedom ♪

00:20:23.346 --> 00:20:28.346
