01:08:36.521 --> 01:08:37.935
I'm thinking in those stories,

01:08:37.935 --> 01:08:39.850
there's so much in both of those stories

01:08:39.850 --> 01:08:41.870
and as much as we understand

01:08:41.870 --> 01:08:43.420
