01:22:28.750 --> 01:22:31.200
this is gonna be a
challenge for you, LaTosha.

01:22:31.200 --> 01:22:35.430
But in two minutes there's
like three demographics

01:22:35.430 --> 01:22:37.560
that folks are interested in in the chat

01:22:37.560 --> 01:22:39.860
and you can pick one or
maybe talk about them,

01:22:39.860 --> 01:22:42.730
how they relate together but
folks are talking about felons

01:22:42.730 --> 01:22:45.023
