back into black women.

01:23:10.090 --> 01:23:11.430
So there's a lot there

01:23:11.430 --> 01:23:12.590
but I just wanted to--
- I'm trying to do

01:23:12.590 --> 01:23:14.090
the speed round.

01:23:14.090 --> 01:23:14.923
- I just wanted to voice that.
I'm trying to do

01:23:14.923 --> 01:23:16.740
