So I'm hoping that in this
moment of great pain and pressure

01:30:30.830 --> 01:30:33.180
that we allow this pressure and this pain

01:30:33.180 --> 01:30:35.670
to really be able to turn it into clarity,

01:30:35.670 --> 01:30:38.540
a sense of clarity for
us so that we go forward

01:30:38.540 --> 01:30:40.280
and we radically reimagine this country.

01:30:40.280 --> 01:30:42.253
So love y'all, thank you so much.

01:30:43.235 --> 01:30:44.177
When we worked together, we win.

